                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.50.0"&gt;3.50.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Add support for Serilog 4.4.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Add support for MSTest 4.3.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ASM] Handle billing issues for standonly mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] Redact sensitive values in expression dumps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OTLP] Removing the path with OtelTracesSpanMetricsEnabled (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4940328001" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8921" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8921/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8921"&gt;#8921&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for Serilog 4.4.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4937508592" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8917" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8917/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8917"&gt;#8917&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(mstest): support ExecuteTestAsync in 4.3 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4960815413" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8934" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8934/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8934"&gt;#8934&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ASM] Set _dd.apm.enabled:0 on all spans (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4941101063" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8923" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8923/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8923"&gt;#8923&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Exclude FSharp.* assemblies from dataflow (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4924398730" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8905" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8905/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8905"&gt;#8905&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AppSec] Report agentic onboarding marker in configuration telemetry (RFC-1113) (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4939800079" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8920" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8920/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8920"&gt;#8920&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix possible namepipe-related issues (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4736300153" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8821" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8821/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8821"&gt;#8821&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Debugger&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Redact sensitive values in expression dumps (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4839071105" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8879" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8879/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8879"&gt;#8879&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move TestOptimizationFeatureTests to TracerInstanceTestCollection (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4840696460" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8880" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8880/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8880"&gt;#8880&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Debugger] Deflake instanceof assembly lookup tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4847642840" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8885" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8885/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8885"&gt;#8885&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore(benchmarks): migrate benchmarking base image to :newest tag (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4947257096" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8924" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8924/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8924"&gt;#8924&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mark CheckProfilesSentThroughNamedPipe Flaky (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4959182041" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8932" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8932/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8932"&gt;#8932&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
